// Category: the `[convergent]` equation flag across later declarations.
//
// HS `addFunSym` rebuilds the signature through the monoid `<>`
// (Term/Maude/Signature.hs), whose `mempty` has the flag off, so a
// `functions:` block AFTER `equations [convergent]:` drops the flag: the
// echo prints `equations:`.  sig_convergent_then_macros is the `macros:`
// twin.  No corpus theory declares functions after convergent equations.

theory SigConvergentThenFunctions
begin

functions: f/1, a/0

equations [convergent]: f(x) = a

functions: g/1

end
